# The registry serves LF, hashes what it serves, and publishes that digest for ever. Leaving this
# repository to check out CRLF after writing that CRLF is the defect would be incoherent.
#
# This is not what makes the digest correct. `registry/canonical.ts` normalises the bytes it hashes,
# because the registry has to be right under any git configuration and not only under this one; the
# line below is so that a working tree here looks like what is published.
* text=auto eol=lf
